{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081870/extras/e4120c5b348b51ed85c12cfac1925744.avif?t=1766342356\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081870/extras_big/e4120c5b348b51ed85c12cfac1925744.webp?t=1766342356 width=1560 height=1016 /></span>Evolutio Tactics is a captivating <strong>Tactical Strategy RPG</strong> that blends <strong>HD-2D pixel art</strong> with <strong>immersive 2.5D environments</strong>. Step into a city where identity is fluid, masks conceal truth, and evolution defines power.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the labyrinthine city of <strong>Waglin</strong>, you awaken within a vast panopticon, a place of secrets, shifting allegiances, and hidden agendas. Guided by a rare evolutionary gift, uncover the truth behind your origin and the enigmatic figure <strong>Charlemagne</strong>, whose unseen influence binds the city\u2019s fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Waglin\u2019s layered streets, unravel conspiracies through branching quests, and reshape the destiny of a world built on deception. Every decision, every transformation, and every battle creates lasting ripples through the city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddec The Power of Evolution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your abilities and redefine how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081870/extras/0eb21949fbca8f7aedb37b219ae549d7.poster.avif?t=1766342356\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081870/extras/0eb21949fbca8f7aedb37b219ae549d7.webm?t=1766342356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081870/extras/0eb21949fbca8f7aedb37b219ae549d7.mp4?t=1766342356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Deep Tactical Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Positioning, terrain, and timing decide every battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081870/extras/1dd2ca6b040e67cdf242ebf6f766476f.poster.avif?t=1766342356\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081870/extras/1dd2ca6b040e67cdf242ebf6f766476f.webm?t=1766342356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081870/extras/1dd2ca6b040e67cdf242ebf6f766476f.mp4?t=1766342356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d A Living Renaissance World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A city of secrets, power, and decay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081870/extras/2217ba377eca78f3c52214639d891bd6.poster.avif?t=1766342356\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081870/extras/2217ba377eca78f3c52214639d891bd6.webm?t=1766342356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081870/extras/2217ba377eca78f3c52214639d891bd6.mp4?t=1766342356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc65 A Cast of Outcasts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlikely allies with their own motives and stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"t